[00:21.98] Legendas por TIAGO ANDERSON
[00:30.08] Within the sound of silence
[00:35.90] In restless dreams I walked alone
[00:40.84] Narrow streets of cobblestone
[00:45.04] Need the halo of a street lamp
[00:49.18] I turned my collar to the cold and damp
[00:53.54] When my eyes were stabbed
[00:56.54] By the flash of a neon light
[00:59.98] That split the night
[01:02.70] And touched the sound of silence
[01:08.82] And in the naked light I saw
[01:12.80] Ten thousand people, maybe more
[01:18.70] People talking without speaking
[01:22.12] People hearing without listening
[01:26.52] People writing songs that voices never shared
[01:34.46] No one did
[01:37.38] Disturb the sound of silence
[01:43.90] Fool said, I, you do not know
[01:47.80] Silence like a cancer grows
[01:51.28] Hear my words that I might teach you
[01:56.66] Take my arms that I might reach you
[02:00.92] But my words like silent raindrops fell
[02:11.78] Echoed in the wells of silence
[02:17.96] And the people bowed and prayed
[02:22.14] To the neon god they made
[02:26.52] And the sign flashed out its warning
[02:29.88] In the words that it was forming
[02:34.18] And the sign said the words of the prophets
[02:38.90] Are written on the subway walls
[02:42.24] And tenement halls
[02:44.98] Whispered in the sounds of silence
